  "core_question": "Which creative + product + offer combinations are generating incremental profitable customers, and how much more can we scale them?",
  "principles": [
    "discover tools before use; the connector server id differs per account",
    "audit agents are read-only; every mutation goes through EXECUTION-PROTOCOL.md",
    "unclassified Meta tools are treated as writes \u2014 fail closed",
    "modelled is never observed; Meta's claims about Meta are PLATFORM_STATED",
    "reconcile Meta's claim against banked orders before any economic conclusion",
    "blended MER uses total ad spend across every channel",
    "never average a ratio across entities",
    "volume gates conclusions; below the purchase floor the answer is INSUFFICIENT_DATA",
    "one creative dataset, written once, read by everything",
    "contribution, not ROAS",
    "gates order the sweep; they never stop it",
    "every section closes with a coverage state; silence is not an outcome",
    "audit skills are evidence; marketing skills are advisory; execution skills are fenced",
    "one material change at a time, with a 14-day read window"
